# Changes to the registry's code, rules and trust list need a maintainer.
# Submissions are deliberately not listed: the auto-merge gate decides those,
# and a code-owner requirement on them would block every automated merge.
# Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the main branch protection.

/.github/                 @revanth-ainl
/scripts/                 @revanth-ainl
/schemas/                 @revanth-ainl
/tests/                   @revanth-ainl
/trusted-publishers.json  @revanth-ainl
/requirements-*.txt       @revanth-ainl
/requirements-*.in        @revanth-ainl
/LICENSE                  @revanth-ainl
